    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bye-Bye Bindings! is a stress-relief clicker game themed around &quot;En&quot; (\u7e01) \u2014 a Japanese cultural concept representing invisible connections or ties between people, objects, and moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with a cute, spirit-like cat companion,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you\u2019ll gently cut through various \u201cbindings\u201d one click at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changing expressions and subtle effects with each cut</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide range of relaxing BGM tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock hand-drawn jacket illustrations as you progress</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're feeling overwhelmed or just need a quiet moment,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this game is here to gently accompany you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd8\u200d Highlights:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely free to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls, suitable for anyone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session takes just 5 minutes \u2014 perfect for a quick reset</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why not take a moment to \u201ccut a tie\u201d and lighten your heart?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bye-Bye Bindings! is a stress-relief clicker game themed around &quot;En&quot; (\u7e01) \u2014 a Japanese cultural concept representing invisible connections or ties between people, objects, and moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with a cute, spirit-like cat companion,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you\u2019ll gently cut through various \u201cbindings\u201d one click at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changing expressions and subtle effects with each cut</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide range of relaxing BGM tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock hand-drawn jacket illustrations as you progress</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're feeling overwhelmed or just need a quiet moment,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this game is here to gently accompany you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd8\u200d Highlights:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely free to play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls, suitable for anyone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session takes just 5 minutes \u2014 perfect for a quick reset</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why not take a moment to \u201ccut a tie\u201d and lighten your heart?</p>",
